==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*12 [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Kyuubei]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

